stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> PREPARING
    PREPARING --> AWAITING_FUNDING: immutable funding plan
    AWAITING_FUNDING --> BTC_TOPUP_PLANNED: note reserve below calculated minimum
    BTC_TOPUP_PLANNED --> BTC_TOPUP_BROADCAST_RECORDED: separate exact confirmation
    BTC_TOPUP_BROADCAST_RECORDED --> AWAITING_FUNDING: confirmed reserve and fresh RGB plan
    AWAITING_FUNDING --> FUNDING_IMPORTED: exact confirmation and broadcast
    FUNDING_IMPORTED --> ACTIVE: exact receive settles
    ACTIVE --> CLAIM_PLANNED: valid capsule and fresh chosen-wallet invoice
    CLAIM_PLANNED --> CLAIMING: exact redemption confirmation
    CLAIMING --> BROADCAST_RECORDED: txid and consignment persisted
    BROADCAST_RECORDED --> REDEMPTION_IMPORTED: chosen wallet imports retained proof
    REDEMPTION_IMPORTED --> REDEEMED: exact transfer and balance settle

    CLAIMING --> AMBIGUOUS: unknown send outcome
    BROADCAST_RECORDED --> IMPORT_RECOVERY_REQUIRED: chosen-wallet import failure
    IMPORT_RECOVERY_REQUIRED --> REDEMPTION_IMPORTED: import retained proof only

    CLAIMING --> PRE_BROADCAST_REJECTED: proven allocation-slot rejection
    PRE_BROADCAST_REJECTED --> CAPACITY_PLANNED: separate Bitcoin plan
    CAPACITY_PLANNED --> CAPACITY_BROADCAST_RECORDED: separate confirmation
    CAPACITY_BROADCAST_RECORDED --> CAPACITY_READY: confirmed free colorable UTXO
    CAPACITY_READY --> CLAIM_PLANNED: fresh redemption plan

    note right of REDEEMED
        Terminal result.
        Plan REDEEMED and claim SPENT.
        Refresh replay cannot send.
    end note

    note right of AMBIGUOUS
        Never resend automatically.
        Manual chain and wallet reconciliation.
    end note
